__doc__ = """Repro 07-04: D4 (P2) `del e2` as-var cleanup leaked into handler body.

In `api_get_financial` the CPython 3.11+ as-var cleanup
(`LOAD_CONST None / STORE_FAST e2 / DELETE_FAST e2`) leaks as a
`del e2` statement inside `if not e2.response:` body (line 173).

Expected defect:
